    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont know if i want to be a \"story of survival\" anymore though. it just feels like i'm stuck in a loop of being hurt. sometimes i think maybe there's just nothing left to save. like, if something is truly shattered, isn't it more logical to just let it go instead of trying to glue the pieces back together forever?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
