      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's not logical to keep gluing—it's human. But you're right that some things can't be put back the way they were. So maybe the goal isn't to rebuild the old shape, but to make something new from the pieces you still have. And if you're too tired to even imagine that right now, that's okay too—you don't have to have an answer today.",
